<title>USA: Hirsch Intl in talks to buy Sedeco.</title>
<headline>Hirsch Intl in talks to buy Sedeco.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hirsch International Corp said on Monday it is in talks to acquire Sedeco Inc, a privately held distrubtor of Tajima Industries Ltd embroidery machines in six states.</p>
<p>A defintive agreement has not yet been reached to acquire the company that distributes the machines in Texas, Arkansas, Oklahoma, Colorado, Louisiana and New Mexico, Hirsch said.</p>
<p>Hirsch is a distributor of embroidery equipment.</p>
</text>
